Nobody can predict the future very well, and you're talking about
projects of very different levels of maturity in the same breath (Motif,
DME).  DME is the newest project on the plate.

> >>Can the contributing companies develop and market their own better products
> >>based on these technologies which isn't necessarily compatible with DCE?
> >>
> >	Probably but would it be a good idea?  They get royalties for
> >	what OSF sells.  It's in their interest to have the market be
